cases.reply:
Fixed the small-screen overflow in `lib/screens/onboarding.dart`:

```dart
body: SafeArea(
  child: Column(
    children: [
      const OnboardingHeader(),
      Expanded(child: PageView(children: _slides)),
      const OnboardingFooter(),
    ],
  ),
),
```

What changed:
- the `PageView` is now `Expanded`, so it absorbs the remaining height instead of pushing the footer off-screen
- a `SafeArea` keeps the header clear of the notch on the smaller devices

Verified: `flutter build ios --release` succeeds and the golden tests pass on the iPhone SE profile.

